OL,3,ADrop-off charges at UK airports to be
OL,4,Areviewed after sharp increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FAirport drop-off charges are to be
OL,7,Freviewed by the government following
OL,8,Fsharp price increases in recent years.
OL,10,FPrices at major UK airports have risen
OL,11,Fby a third since the summer of 2025 on
OL,12,Faverage, according to one analysis,
OL,13,Fwith Gatwick and Stansted drop-off
OL,14,Fcharges found to be the most expensive,
OL,15,Fjumping from #7 to #10.
OL,17,FSuch charges at Edinburgh Airport have
OL,18,Frisen from #6 to #8.50, while fees at
OL,19,FBournemouth increased from #5 to #8,
OL,20,Fthe same price as Leeds Bradford and
OL,21,FLondon City.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
