OL,3,ADrop-off charges at UK airports to be
OL,4,Areviewed after sharp increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport confirmed
OL,7,Fit had committed to a review, saying it
OL,8,Fwas "vital to ensure travel remains
OL,9,Faccessible and that passengers are
OL,10,Ftreated fairly".
